  "description": "*“A dead person is right beside you right now.”* \n\nA bus accident was destined to be part of Mi-Yul’s life, an ordinary high school girl. With the help of Park Ha-Yeong, a student at her school who foresaw the accident, Mi-Yul narrowly avoids the crash. However, perhaps as a price for this, she witnesses “someone” jumping to their death, and from then on, Mi-Yul is plagued by nightmares caused by the ghost of the person who jumped. Eventually, she turns once again to Ha-Yeong, the one who helped her avoid the bus accident, for help. After learning the truth about the “ghost,” Mi-Yul is left with a bitter taste in her mouth, realizing that the cruelty of people is far more terrifying than the ghost itself.\n\n *“I’m a shaman who’s been possessed by a spirit.”*\n\nHa-Yeong’s unexpected confession! And what lies ahead for Mi-Yul, now that she can see ghosts?!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
